  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Syria Initiative (phase three)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to support and capacitate Syrians to proactively participate in the change process in their country towards a sustainable and inclusive peace. The main project objective is to empower Syrians to lead the necessary local, national and international platforms to manage the transformation of violent conflict into a non-violent political arena.</narrative>
  </description>
